+Added `beacons.status` to report, per configured beacon, when it last actually fired and whether that run raised an error. Status is tracked live as beacons run, so it reflects real activity without waiting for a new probe cycle, reading logs, or restarting the minion. A beacon that has not fired yet reports `last_run: None` instead of a stale or guessed value.
